              {
                "question": "Do you deliver?",
                "answer": "We offer local delivery within [Primary City] on orders over $20. See the ordering options above."
              },
              {
                "question": "Do you cater events?",
                "answer": "Yes. We offer catering trays for offices, events, and gatherings. Order at least 48 hours ahead."
              },
              {
                "question": "Is your menu gluten-free or vegan?",
                "answer": "We focus on naturally leavened sourdough, which is easier to digest. A limited vegan and gluten-free selection rotates daily — ask at the counter."
